# Environment Variables Configuration - Complete Setup

## 🎯 What You Can Now Do

You have **3 main environment variables** fully configured:

### 1️⃣ **HEADED** - See the browser while tests run
```bash
npm run test:headed        # Browser window visible ✓
npm test                   # Browser hidden (headless) ✓
```

### 2️⃣ **CUCUMBER_TAGS** - Run specific test scenarios
```bash
npm run test:tags          # Run @smoke tests ✓
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@regression" npm test  # Custom tags ✓
```

### 3️⃣ **CUCUMBER_WORKERS** - Run tests in parallel
```bash
npm run test:parallel      # 4 parallel workers ✓
npm test                   # Serial execution ✓
```

