## 🔧 How to Use

### Example 1: Debug a test with visible browser
```bash
npm run test:headed
```

### Example 2: Run tests faster (parallel)
```bash
npm run test:parallel
```

### Example 3: Run specific tests by tag
```bash
cross-env CUCUMBER_TAGS="@critical" npm test
```

### Example 4: Run tests with all options combined
```bash
cross-env HEADED=true CUCUMBER_TAGS="@smoke" CUCUMBER_WORKERS=4 npm test
```

